{"chapters":[{"title":"The question","frames":[{"caption":"Multiplying a p&times;q by a q&times;r matrix costs p&middot;q&middot;r scalar multiplications. The product A&middot;B&middot;C&middot;D can be parenthesised in many ways with very different costs. Find the cheapest.","grid":{"v":[["40x20","20x30","30x10","10x30"]],"cls":[["","","",""]],"rowLabels":["matrix"],"colLabels":["A","B","C","D"]}}]},{"title":"Fill by interval length","frames":[{"caption":"Use the dimension boundaries d0..d4 as indices: <code>dp[i][j]</code> = cheapest cost to multiply the matrices between boundary i and boundary j. A single matrix (j = i + 1) costs nothing.","grid":{"v":[["","0","","",""],["","","0","",""],["","","","0",""],["","","","","0"],["","","","",""]],"cls":[["none","base","empty","empty","empty"],["none","none","base","empty","empty"],["none","none","none","base","empty"],["none","none","none","none","base"],["none","none","none","none","none"]],"rowLabels":["d0=40","d1=20","d2=30","d3=10","d4=30"],"colLabels":["d0=40","d1=20","d2=30","d3=10","d4=30"]},"formula":"dp[i][i+1] = 0"},{"caption":"Interval [0, 2]: try each split point k in between and keep the cheapest. Best is k = 1.","grid":{"v":[["","0","24000","",""],["","","0","",""],["","","","0",""],["","","","","0"],["","","","",""]],"cls":[["none","src","cur","empty","empty"],["none","none","src","empty","empty"],["none","none","none","base","empty"],["none","none","none","none","base"],["none","none","none","none","none"]],"rowLabels":["d0=40","d1=20","d2=30","d3=10","d4=30"],"colLabels":["d0=40","d1=20","d2=30","d3=10","d4=30"]},"formula":"k=1: 0+0+24000=24000","arrows":[[0,1,0,2],[1,2,0,2]]},{"caption":"Interval [1, 3]: try each split point k in between and keep the cheapest. Best is k = 2.","grid":{"v":[["","0","24000","",""],["","","0","6000",""],["","","","0",""],["","","","","0"],["","","","",""]],"cls":[["none","base","done","empty","empty"],["none","none","src","cur","empty"],["none","none","none","src","empty"